OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother primarily sunny day
OL,6,Fwith just a little wispy high cloud at
OL,7,Ftimes. Breezier than on Monday and
OL,8,Ffeeling slightly cooler in some
OL,9,Fcoastal regions. Otherwise, becoming
OL,10,Fvery warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,13,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,14,Fclear periods and small amounts of
OL,15,Fcloud. Staying rather warm in urban
OL,16,Fareas but cooler in the countryside by
OL,17,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
