OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Feeling widely
OL,8,Fhot, locally very hot.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHot
OL,11,For very hot with temperatures peaking
OL,12,Fon Thursday with plenty of strong
OL,13,Fsunshine. Similar on Friday, with
OL,14,Ffresher conditions and cloudier
OL,15,Fconditions by Saturday.
